&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;  （当事業年度において株式数が増加した銘柄）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:48.5pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:406.6pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
